ll me every day, while I am at work. ( attached are phone records of these calls ) As you can see this is not the typical situation with an account, but I have never had a bank or lender refuse to work with someone willing to pay the balance due and to be so secretive and deceitful in the handling of an account. It is only after repeated attempts to work this out directly with Santander do I submit this Complaint and ask for the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau for help. 

