7457920,2023-08-26,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"Attention : Consumer Financial Protection Bureau I am submitting a complaint against Capital One Bank, based on numerous attempts to have my Name/SSN removed from my Ex-Wifes credit card account, which was awarded to her in our Marital Divorce Decree, signed on the XXXX of XX/XX/XXXX. 
