7463033,2023-08-28,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Trouble using your card,Can't use card to make purchases,"Date of incident XX/XX/2023 Kohl 's recently partnered with Capital One to handle credit card payments for them. Until today I would have had an option to use my Kohl 's card or the Kohl 's VISA card with Capital One when I logged in. Today the only option I had was the Kohl 's VISA card. 

